<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Chatmobílli — Exportação de Conversas</title>
  <style>
    /* ── Reset & base ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11pt;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      background: #fff;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* ── Print optimisations ──────────────────────────────────── */
    @media print {
      @page {
        margin: 15mm 15mm 20mm 15mm;
        size: A4 portrait;
      }

      .no-print { display: none !important; }

      /* NÃO usar page-break-inside: avoid em .conversation-block/.message-row — ambos podem
         ficar maiores que uma pagina inteira (conversa longa, ou mensagem com anexo de imagem
         grande). Quando isso acontece, o navegador nao consegue honrar "avoid": ele empurra o
         bloco inteiro pra pagina seguinte mesmo sem caber, deixando a pagina anterior com um
         espaco em branco enorme, em cascata — e a imagem ainda corta no meio de qualquer jeito.
         Só o cabecalho (pequeno, tamanho sempre previsivel) fica protegido de ficar orfao. */
      .conversation-header { page-break-after: avoid; }

      /* .attachment--image is safe to protect: HtmlExporter::MAX_IMAGE_HEIGHT guarantees every
         embedded image already fits within one page's printable height, so "avoid" can always
         actually be honored here (unlike .conversation-block/.message-row above) — it just
         pushes the image to start on a fresh page when it doesn't fit the remaining space,
         instead of splitting it mid-image. */
      .attachment--image { page-break-inside: avoid; }

      /* Ensure URLs are visible in print */
      a[href]::after {
        content: " [" attr(href) "]";
        font-size: 8pt;
        color: #555;
        word-break: break-all;
      }
    }

    /* ── Layout ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .container {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    /* ── Report header ────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .report-header {
      border-bottom: 3px solid #DB7F2B;
      padding-bottom: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .report-header__brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .report-header__brand-name {
      font-size: 18pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #DB7F2B;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    }

    .report-header__logo { display: inline-block; }

    .report-header__logo svg {
      height: 46px;
      width: auto;
      display: block;
    }

    .report-header__subtitle {
      font-size: 10pt;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .meta-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4px 24px;
      font-size: 9.5pt;
    }

    .meta-grid__label {
      color: #666;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 8pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    }

    .meta-grid__value {
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    /* ── Contact section ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    .contact-section {
      background: #FDF6EF;
      border: 1px solid #F0D9BF;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .contact-section__title {
      font-size: 10pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #DB7F2B;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    /* ── Conversation block ───────────────────────────────────── */
    .conversation-block {
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .conversation-header {
      background: #DB7F2B;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .conversation-header__id {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 11pt;
    }

    .conversation-header__status {
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2px 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    }

    .conversation-meta {
      background: #FDF4EA;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 4px 20px;
      font-size: 9pt;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    }

    .conversation-meta__label {
      color: #666;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    }

    /* ── Timeline ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .timeline {
      padding: 8px 0;
    }

    .message-row {
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .message-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .message-row--private {
      background: #fffbec;
      border-left: 3px solid #f0a500;
    }

    .message-row--activity {
      background: #f6f6f6;
      text-align: center;
      color: #888;
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      font-style: italic;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .message-row__time {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      font-size: 8pt;
      color: #888;
      width: 82px;
      padding-top: 2px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .message-row__id {
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 7pt;
      color: #aaa;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .message-row__reply-ref {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 8pt;
      color: #DB7F2B;
      background: #FBEEDE;
      border-left: 2px solid #DB7F2B;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .message-row__body {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .message-row__sender {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: #333;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .message-row__sender--agent { color: #DB7F2B; }
    .message-row__sender--client { color: #2e7d32; }

    .message-row__private-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 7pt;
      background: #f0a500;
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 3px;
      padding: 1px 5px;
      margin-left: 6px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    .message-row__text {
      font-size: 10pt;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    /* ── Attachment blocks ────────────────────────────────────── */
    .attachment {
      margin-top: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .attachment--image img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }

    .attachment--media {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: #f8f8f8;
      font-size: 9pt;
    }

    .attachment--media__icon {
      font-size: 14pt;
      margin-right: 4px;
    }

    .attachment--media__name {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #333;
    }

    .attachment--media__size {
      color: #888;
      font-size: 8pt;
      margin-left: 4px;
    }

    .attachment--media__url {
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: #DB7F2B;
      word-break: break-all;
      display: block;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .attachment--location {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: #f8f8f8;
      font-size: 9pt;
    }

    /* ── Integrity footer ─────────────────────────────────────── */
    .integrity-section {
      margin-top: 32px;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      background: #fafafa;
    }

    .integrity-section__title {
      font-size: 9pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #444;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .integrity-section__hash {
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 8pt;
      color: #333;
      word-break: break-all;
      background: #eee;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }

    .integrity-section__note {
      font-size: 8pt;
      color: #777;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    /* ── Print button (hidden on print) ──────────────────────── */
    .print-btn {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 24px;
      right: 24px;
      background: #DB7F2B;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      font-size: 12pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(219,127,43,0.35);
      z-index: 9999;
    }

    .print-btn:hover { background: #B8691F; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <!-- ── Report header ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="report-header">
    <div class="report-header__brand">
      <% if @logo_svg.present? %>
        <span class="report-header__logo"><%= raw @logo_svg %></span>
      <% else %>
        <span class="report-header__brand-name">Chatmobílli</span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <div class="report-header__subtitle">Exportação de Conversas — Documento gerado para fins de registro e auditoria</div>

    <div class="meta-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="meta-grid__label">Gerado em</div>
        <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= @generated_at %></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="meta-grid__label">Gerado por</div>
        <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= @exported_by.name %> (<%= @exported_by.email %>)</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="meta-grid__label">Conta</div>
        <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= @account.name %></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="meta-grid__label">Total de conversas</div>
        <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= @conversations.size %></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Contact section ───────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="contact-section">
    <div class="contact-section__title">Dados do Contato</div>
    <div class="meta-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="meta-grid__label">Nome</div>
        <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= @contact.name %></div>
      </div>
      <% if @contact.phone_number.present? %>
      <div>
        <div class="meta-grid__label">Telefone</div>
        <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= @contact.phone_number %></div>
      </div>
      <% end %>
      <% if @contact.email.present? %>
      <div>
        <div class="meta-grid__label">E-mail</div>
        <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= @contact.email %></div>
      </div>
      <% end %>
      <% if @contact.identifier.present? %>
      <div>
        <div class="meta-grid__label">Identificador</div>
        <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= @contact.identifier %></div>
      </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Conversations ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <% @conversations.each do |item| %>
    <% conv = item[:conversation] %>
    <div class="conversation-block">

      <div class="conversation-header">
        <span class="conversation-header__id">Conversa #<%= conv.display_id %></span>
        <span class="conversation-header__status"><%= conv.status.upcase %></span>
      </div>

      <div class="conversation-meta">
        <div>
          <div class="meta-grid__label">Canal</div>
          <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= item[:channel] %></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="meta-grid__label">Agentes Responsáveis</div>
          <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= item[:assignees] %></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="meta-grid__label">Início</div>
          <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= conv.created_at.in_time_zone('Brasilia').strftime('%d/%m/%Y %H:%M') %></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="meta-grid__label">Encerramento</div>
          <div class="meta-grid__value">
            <%= conv.resolved? ? conv.updated_at.in_time_zone('Brasilia').strftime('%d/%m/%Y %H:%M') : '—' %>
          </div>
        </div>
        <% if item[:bot_first_response].present? %>
        <div>
          <div class="meta-grid__label">1ª Resposta do Robô</div>
          <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= item[:bot_first_response] %></div>
        </div>
        <% end %>
        <% if item[:agent_first_response].present? %>
        <div>
          <div class="meta-grid__label">1ª Resposta do Agente</div>
          <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= item[:agent_first_response] %></div>
        </div>
        <% end %>
        <% if item[:labels].present? %>
        <div>
          <div class="meta-grid__label">Etiquetas</div>
          <div class="meta-grid__value"><%= item[:labels] %></div>
        </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>

      <!-- Timeline -->
      <div class="timeline">
        <% if item[:messages].empty? %>
          <div class="message-row message-row--activity">Nenhuma mensagem registrada nesta conversa.</div>
        <% end %>

        <% item[:messages].each do |m| %>
          <% msg = m[:message] %>

          <% if msg.message_type.to_s == 'activity' %>
            <div class="message-row message-row--activity">
              <span><%= m[:timestamp] %> — <%= msg.content.presence || 'Atividade do sistema' %></span>
            </div>

          <% else %>
            <div class="message-row<%= ' message-row--private' if m[:private] %>">
              <div class="message-row__time">
                <div><%= m[:timestamp] %></div>
                <div class="message-row__id">#<%= m[:id] %></div>
              </div>
              <div class="message-row__body">
                <div class="message-row__sender <%= msg.incoming? ? 'message-row__sender--client' : 'message-row__sender--agent' %>">
                  <%= m[:sender] %>
                  <% if m[:private] %>
                    <span class="message-row__private-badge">⚠ Nota Interna</span>
                  <% end %>
                </div>

                <% if m[:in_reply_to].present? %>
                  <div class="message-row__reply-ref">⇌ Respondendo a mensagem #<%= m[:in_reply_to] %></div>
                <% end %>

                <% if m[:content].present? %>
                  <div class="message-row__text"><%= m[:content] %></div>
                <% end %>

                <% m[:attachments].each do |att| %>
                  <div class="attachment">
                    <% case att[:type] %>
                    <% when :image %>
                      <div class="attachment--image">
                        <% if att[:data_uri].present? %>
                          <img src="<%= att[:data_uri] %>" alt="<%= att[:filename] %>">
                        <% else %>
                          <div class="attachment--media">
                            🖼 <span class="attachment--media__name"><%= att[:filename] %></span>
                            <span class="attachment--media__note">(imagem não pôde ser carregada)</span>
                          </div>
                        <% end %>
                      </div>
                    <% when :audio %>
                      <div class="attachment--media">
                        <span class="attachment--media__icon">🎙️</span>
                        <span class="attachment--media__name"><%= att[:filename].presence || 'Áudio' %></span>
                        <span class="attachment--media__size"><%= att[:size] %></span>
                        <a class="attachment--media__url" href="<%= att[:url] %>"><%= att[:url] %></a>
                      </div>
                    <% when :video %>
                      <div class="attachment--media">
                        <span class="attachment--media__icon">🎬</span>
                        <span class="attachment--media__name"><%= att[:filename].presence || 'Vídeo' %></span>
                        <span class="attachment--media__size"><%= att[:size] %></span>
                        <a class="attachment--media__url" href="<%= att[:url] %>"><%= att[:url] %></a>
                      </div>
                    <% when :file %>
                      <div class="attachment--media">
                        <span class="attachment--media__icon">📎</span>
                        <span class="attachment--media__name"><%= att[:filename].presence || 'Arquivo' %></span>
                        <span class="attachment--media__size"><%= att[:size] %></span>
                        <a class="attachment--media__url" href="<%= att[:url] %>"><%= att[:url] %></a>
                      </div>
                    <% when :location %>
                      <div class="attachment--location">
                        📍 <strong><%= att[:title].presence || 'Localização' %></strong>
                        — Lat: <%= att[:lat] %>, Long: <%= att[:lng] %>
                      </div>
                    <% else %>
                      <div class="attachment--media">
                        📁 <span class="attachment--media__name"><%= att[:filename].presence || 'Arquivo' %></span>
                        <% if att[:url].present? %>
                          <a class="attachment--media__url" href="<%= att[:url] %>"><%= att[:url] %></a>
                        <% end %>
                      </div>
                    <% end %>
                  </div>
                <% end %>
              </div>
            </div>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% end %>

  <!-- ── Integrity footer ──────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="integrity-section">
    <div class="integrity-section__title">Assinatura de Integridade</div>
    <div class="integrity-section__hash">SHA-256: <%= @sha256 %></div>
    <div class="integrity-section__note">
      Este documento foi gerado automaticamente pelo sistema Chatmobílli em <%= @generated_at %>.
      O hash SHA-256 acima é calculado com base no conteúdo de todas as mensagens exportadas e pode ser
      utilizado para verificar que o conteúdo não foi alterado após a geração.
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<!-- Print button (hidden on print) -->
<button class="print-btn no-print" onclick="window.print()">🖨 Imprimir</button>

<script>
  // Auto-trigger print dialog when opened in a new window via the export flow
  if (window.opener) {
    window.addEventListener('load', function () {
      setTimeout(function () { window.print(); }, 600);
    });
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
